    "description": "You can use your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check modifier in place of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> check modifier when making <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> checks. If you are entitled to an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Acrobatics\" title=\"Acrobatics\">Acrobatics</a> check reroll, you may reroll your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).<br><br>Additionally, when you attempt a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> or attempt to break free of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to be treated as if you were one size category larger.",
